<title>USA: Lynx Golf Inc President Ronald Drapeau resigns.</title>
<headline>Lynx Golf Inc President Ronald Drapeau resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lynx Golf Inc said Ronald Drapeau had resigned as president of the company, which makes and markets golf clubs and accessories.</p>
<p>It said Drapeau would remain as a consultant for the company in addition to pursuing other business interests.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
